  I18N.dict.en["app.430"] = "💡 Brands whose procurement status is set to \"Stop Sourcing\": excluded from replenishment suggestions (suggested purchase fixed at 0), excluded from PO candidates, not required to meet target turnover rules, and do not block full-page recalculation, but remain visible on the demand forecast page (for inventory clearance)."; I18N.dict.id["app.430"] = "💡 Merek dengan status pengadaan \"Hentikan Sourcing\": dikecualikan dari saran pengadaan (pembelian yang disarankan tetap 0), dikecualikan dari kandidat PO, tidak diwajibkan memenuhi aturan perputaran target, dan tidak menghalangi perhitungan ulang seluruh halaman, namun tetap terlihat di halaman perkiraan permintaan (untuk pembersihan inventaris).";
